      "section_path": [
        "10 安全配置指南",
        "10.4 证书管理和维护",
        "10.4.2 证书安全维护"
      ],
      "section_title": "10.4.2 证书安全维护",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n设备出厂自带默认PKI 颁发的证书，建议导入客户的签名证书。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        129.366,
        503.216,
        396.549,
        514.169
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-1294EA0594DF6992",
      "document_id": "DOC-DF116E7199E2",
      "source_sha256": "e8c23ac43317f1ca9092017ee420c2f9dd29b3734e10a2247f0e7992014a83bc",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 23,
      "printed_page_label": "19",
      "block_order": 12,
      "section_id": "SEC-B6320DCD99E6A5B9",
      "section_path": [
        "10 安全配置指南",
        "10.4 证书管理和维护",
        "10.4.2 证书安全维护"
      ],
      "section_title": "10.4.2 证书安全维护",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n若使用NTS 功能，客户需导入NTS 服务器证书。NTS 证书从NTS 服务器获\n取，支持PEM 格式的X.509 证书导入。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        129.366,
        518.216,
        447.291,
        542.669
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-DB79507AFAE893E1",
      "document_id": "DOC-DF116E7199E2",
      "source_sha256": "e8c23ac43317f1ca9092017ee420c2f9dd29b3734e10a2247f0e7992014a83bc",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 23,
      "printed_page_label": "19",
      "block_order": 13,
      "section_id": "SEC-B6320DCD99E6A5B9",
      "section_path": [
        "10 安全配置指南",
        "10.4 证书管理和维护",
        "10.4.2 证书安全维护"
      ],
      "section_title": "10.4.2 证书安全维护",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n用户未导入第三方证书的情况下，服务端的HTTPS、IEC104、MODBUS 证书使\n用默认转发证书。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
